"whatsnew_021_action_boards" = "See boards";
"whatsnew_021_action_go" = "Got it";
"whatsnew_021_body" = "• Zone search — in the hold search, drag a frame on the board photo and find every climb that lives entirely inside it.\n\n• Kilter playlists arrive as lists — logging in with your Kilter account now also imports your playlists.\n\n• Share any climb — every climb gets a link that opens straight in CruxCoach.\n\n• Lists across boards — saved lists now show all your climbs, each with its board badge and a board filter.";
"whatsnew_021_hint" = "Easy to miss in 0.2.0: MoonBoard and the Aurora boards (Tension, Grasshopper and more), a worldwide board map and a find-your-gym picker — all in Settings.";
"whatsnew_021_title" = "New in 0.2.1";
"whatsnew_022_action_later" = "Later";
"whatsnew_022_action_moon_import" = "Import Moon logbook";
"whatsnew_022_body" = "• Play lists as workouts — with rests, one-tap logging, a final summary and planning from your logbook.\n\n• Bring over your logbook directly from the installed Moon app or from a CSV file.\n\n• Connect Quantum Boards, see occupied layers live and find climbs with zero or at most one overlap.\n\n• Share your connected board with other board apps through CruxRelay.";
"whatsnew_022_hint" = "Also new: MoonBoard 2010 and Mini 2025, faster reconnecting, clearer board selection and more control over when a climb is sent to the wall.";
"whatsnew_022_title" = "New in 0.2.2";
"whatsnew_023_body" = "• Statistics count distinct problems as Flash, Sent or Attempt. Total tries remain visible.\n\n• Filter totals match the list, including results beyond the first 50.\n\n• Random search is more reliable while scrolling.\n\n• Switch boards from the compact header and open beta videos from climb details.";
"whatsnew_023_title" = "New in 0.2.3";
"whatsnew_aurora_body" = "0.2.0 also adds the Aurora-family boards — Tension, Grasshopper, Decoy, So iLL and Touchstone — alongside Kilter and MoonBoard. Browse each board's catalogue with the same grade, angle and setter filters, open a climb, and light it up on your board over Bluetooth.";
"whatsnew_aurora_hint" = "Pick your board in Settings → board type. Its catalogue downloads on first selection; the board-fit filter and the locations map work for these boards too.";
"whatsnew_aurora_import_action_later" = "Later";
"whatsnew_aurora_import_action_now" = "Import now";
"whatsnew_aurora_import_body" = "0.1.4 ingests the email JSON Aurora sends after a data-export request. Your historical ascents, attempts and playlists land in CruxCoach's logbook with one tap.";
"whatsnew_aurora_import_hint" = "Have the JSON file already? Tap \"Import now\". Otherwise the importer stays in Settings → Migrate from Aurora — request the export first, come back later.";
"whatsnew_aurora_import_title" = "Aurora data — import it now";
"whatsnew_aurora_title" = "New: Tension, Grasshopper & more";
"whatsnew_board_map_action_later" = "Later";
"whatsnew_board_map_action_now" = "Open map";
"whatsnew_board_map_body" = "0.2.0 puts every known Kilter and MoonBoard installation on an interactive world map. Tap the map icon next to hold-search in the board browser, pan around, tap a marker for the gym's address, phone, email, and a direct link into the climbs for that board's exact layout and size.";
"whatsnew_board_map_hint" = "Filters cover board brand, layout family, country, public-vs-private, adjustability and size. The \"Matches my board\" filter narrows the markers to gyms whose hardware fits the board you configured in Settings.";
"whatsnew_board_map_title" = "New: boards on a map";
"whatsnew_done" = "Done";
"whatsnew_gym_picker_action_later" = "Later";
"whatsnew_gym_picker_action_now" = "Open Settings";
"whatsnew_gym_picker_body" = "In Settings → Board size, \"Change\" now offers a \"Find gym\" path. Search your gym, pick the wall, done — no more guessing the product-size code from the dropdown.";
"whatsnew_gym_picker_hint" = "The manual list is still there as a fallback for setters and home-wall owners who know their hardware off the top of their head.";
"whatsnew_gym_picker_title" = "New: pick your board by gym";
"whatsnew_moonboard_action_later" = "Later";
"whatsnew_moonboard_action_now" = "Pick my board";
"whatsnew_moonboard_body" = "Beyond Kilter, 0.2.0 adds full MoonBoard support and the Aurora boards — Tension, Grasshopper, Decoy, So iLL and Touchstone. Browse each catalogue with the same grade, angle and setter filters, and light up boulders on your board over Bluetooth.";
"whatsnew_moonboard_hint" = "Also new: a worldwide board-locations map and a find-your-gym board picker — both in Settings.";
"whatsnew_moonboard_title" = "New in 0.2.0: MoonBoard + Aurora boards";
"whatsnew_nostr_backup_body" = "Your climbs and notes can now be encrypted on this device and stored online across several public servers — restore them on any device. Off by default; enable here, or anytime in Settings → Encrypted cloud backup.";
"whatsnew_nostr_backup_consent" = "A CruxCoach Account key is created on this device if you don't already have one. Backups don't run automatically — you start them yourself in Settings.";
"whatsnew_nostr_backup_title" = "New: Encrypted cloud backup";
"whatsnew_nostr_backup_toggle" = "Enable backup";
